      "yanked": false,
      "notes": "AgentRT v0.1.14-rc1\n\n> 候选版本（Release Candidate）：供测试与预览，接口和行为可能继续调整；生产部署请等待正式版。\n\n## 平台支持\n\n- Linux（主力平台）：x86-64 / x86-32 / ARM64 / ARM32\n- macOS：x86-64（Intel）/ ARM64（Apple Silicon）\n- Windows：x86-64 / x86-32\n\n## 安装\n\n```bash\ncurl -fsSL https://atomgit.com/openairymax/agentrt/releases/download/v0.1.14-rc1/install.sh | bash\n```\n\nWindows（PowerShell）：\n```powershell\nirm https://atomgit.com/openairymax/agentrt/releases/download/v0.1.14-rc1/install.ps1 | iex\n```\n\n## 本版变更\n\n* github: gate TUI IME on runtime string, not symbols\n* github: fix libairy_common resolution for container TUI builds\n* agents: bump daemons for security test contract update\n* agents: bump daemons and atoms for 0.1.14 runtime fixes\n* airy_cli: surface real gateway errors and arg parse diagnostics\n* airy_cli: build gateway request bodies at actual length\n* github: inject version and IME lib into TUI release builds",
